@startuml
title watch PATH — Add a watched path
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
participant "Inspection / instrumentation" as I
U -> UI : watch PATH
UI -> S : add_watch(PATH)
S -> I : Validate path syntax; value may be unavailable
S -> S : Add unless already watched
UI -> UI : show_watches()
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
